{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/c06c981cf8623362b30ca9d55ce0f74e.avif?t=1760614025\" width=720 height=298 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/5a305367d04917ddfe78f1a616844411.avif?t=1760614025\" width=1560 height=77 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/5dd1b3614dacfa600a7315692167336f.poster.avif?t=1760614025\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/5dd1b3614dacfa600a7315692167336f.webm?t=1760614025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/5dd1b3614dacfa600a7315692167336f.mp4?t=1760614025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cosy farm in a bright post-apocalypse where every day smells of soil and hope, and every night asks you to be brave. Plant, nurture and decorate your little refuge by day. Hold it together by night. This is gentle work with heart and a little danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Rory, a stubborn farmer with a soft spot for people and plants. When the Fall happened, you somehow became indebted and now work for the government by supplying food to most of the survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/4725bba564a0f71ed747f45a8749c8dc.avif?t=1760614025\" width=1560 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/9aa3f08e19e4ac2edba3d5c175a51699.poster.avif?t=1760614025\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/9aa3f08e19e4ac2edba3d5c175a51699.webm?t=1760614025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/9aa3f08e19e4ac2edba3d5c175a51699.mp4?t=1760614025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops, sell your harvest, and reinvest in seeds, tools and upgrades to slowly turn a tiny homestead into a flourishing refuge. Start with a limited farm and expand it plot by plot, unlocking new crops, decorations and mechanics along the way. Farming feels tactile and comforting, with satisfying loops of sowing and harvesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/0d089a8a08833824c14969e442642bba.avif?t=1760614025\" width=1363 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/2d65cc2d2c6a33cd0eb6aa5e920eedf0.poster.avif?t=1760614025\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/2d65cc2d2c6a33cd0eb6aa5e920eedf0.webm?t=1760614025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/2d65cc2d2c6a33cd0eb6aa5e920eedf0.mp4?t=1760614025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night brings waves of unfed. They will break through walls to get inside, so clever layout and strong defenses matter more than ever. Build barricades, turrets, traps and use your super death Mecha to defend your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/197e07fa6b213c24d32818f57070ad4b.avif?t=1760614025\" width=1231 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add farming and watering robots to automate the routine. They plant, irrigate and harvest so you can focus on bigger things: expansion, decoration and strategy. Upgrade them, rename them and make them part of the crew. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/2b9f219b0a119dde6c34e756912fab8c.avif?t=1760614025\" width=1065 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/831020655e3c685fb024778c1aa31f18.poster.avif?t=1760614025\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/831020655e3c685fb024778c1aa31f18.webm?t=1760614025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/831020655e3c685fb024778c1aa31f18.mp4?t=1760614025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect decoration tokens and spend them on unique and beautiful items. Decorations make your farm feel lived in and can be arranged alongside defenses to look beautiful and practical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/db8a4be6366f00e414d72193a4d9eb5b.avif?t=1760614025\" width=1257 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When fences crumble or machines fail, jump into short mini-games to repair them. These quick, satisfying challenges keep you busy while crops grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/39fda34196dc4676201f60f2b548216b.avif?t=1760614025\" width=1300 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ivy is a pragmatic government agent who offers missions, upgrades, and tools to help your homestead grow safer and stronger. She monitors your progress and serves as the eyes of the government you are indebted to. Don\u2019t stray from your path, it may be something you come to regret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3783050?t=1760614025","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/0a532f4c94a8cdd013bd3ff56c613d37143318ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760614025","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/6a1014a17e7771744c58d90488db202073a33f53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760614025","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/6a1014a17e7771744c58d90488db202073a33f53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760614025","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3939960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Us!</h1><p><p c