 somehow became indebted and now work for the government by supplying food to most of the survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/4725bba564a0f71ed747f45a8749c8dc.avif?t=1760614025\" width=1560 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/9aa3f08e19e4ac2edba3d5c175a51699.poster.avif?t=1760614025\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/9aa3f08e19e4ac2edba3d5c175a51699.webm?t=1760614025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/9aa3f08e19e4ac2edba3d5c175a51699.mp4?t=1760614025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops, sell your harvest, and reinvest in seeds, tools and upgrades to slowly turn a tiny homestead into a flourishing refuge. Start with a limited farm and expand it plot by plot, unlocking new crops, decorations and mechanics along the way. Farming feels tactile and comforting, with satisfying loops of sowing and harvesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/0d089a8a08833824c14969e442642bba.avif?t=1760614025\" width=1363 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783050/extras/2d65cc2d2c6a33cd0eb6aa5e920eedf0.poster.avif?t=1760614025\" width=11